  "prefLabel": "Lan 403.06 Noncompliance",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lan 403.06 Noncompliance. Failure to complete continuing education requirements in a timely fashion, or failure to submit documentation which establishes that said requirements were so completed, shall after notice and opportunity for hearing, result in disciplinary action unless a waiver petition has been timely filed and duly granted by the board.\n\nSource. #7549, 8-25-01; ss by #9340, eff 1-1-09; ss by #12031, eff 11-1-16",
